      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The moor is a quiet place where the story can finally breathe. The silence is not empty, but full of a gentle promise that everything will eventually rest. You can let the mist carry you and feel the weight lift. It is a beautiful, peaceful end to the struggle.",
